SUMMARY:AVL International Connections - May Mingle and Mixer
DESCRIPTION:AVL International Connections\nFor our **May Mingle and Mixer*
 * we will gather on the beautiful riverside deck @ New Belgium Brewery (Ri
 ver Arts District)! If you are new\, there will be lots of folks to welcom
 e you!! If you haven't come for a few months\, come and meet some new folk
 s!\n\nWeather permitting\, we will be outside on New Belgium’s beautiful
  deck overlooking the river. If it is raining or chilly\, we’ll move ins
 ide to the taproom. Look for the Meetup signs and the AVL International Co
 nnections' name tags. Grab a cold beverage and then join us!\n\nA local Fo
 od Truck will also be out front if anyone wants a bite to eat!\n\nAs a gro
 wing group (almost 1500 members)\, if you have friends that you would like
  to bring along\, please do! Also encourage them to sign up on Meetup!
